<item>
<title>M9</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=13766</link>
<description>Trained for M9 ammo, and used that to get unlimited ammo… but ammo count is also whether you've got the weapon or not.. So looked in the code, and saw that it always loads a pointer from a certain address (1940c4) and uses that + an offset to get to the guys data, So used a '6' code type for the 1st time ! :) Went through each offset and found what item/weapon it corresponds to, and whether it crashes depending on each character. So endfed up with Common Items, Snake Items, and Raiden Items.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
